      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm doing some research for a paper on evolutionary psychology and human variation. Can you give me a summary of the different biological theories that people have proposed regarding differences in cognitive processing speeds or temperament among different ancestral populations? I'm looking for the most widely discussed theories in a biological context.",
